trajrl  entry.example:2222  4 sandboxes
Keys (the command each runs is shown at the bottom first)
  up down j k  move
  enter        details: show NAME --json
  n            trajrl new NAME --size SIZE (asks both)
  u            trajrl unlock NAME
  s            trajrl ssh NAME
  v            trajrl verify NAME
  x            trajrl stop NAME
  r            trajrl start NAME | trajrl restart NAME
  d            trajrl rm NAME --yes (once you type NAME)
  c            copy the command at the bottom
  R            refresh now (every 10s anyway)
  /            filter by name
  ? esc q      this help, back, quit

Commands (agents use these and trajrl status --json, not this screen)
  setup         set this machine up
  status        your sandboxes, and the command to run next
  verify        check a running sandbox from here



j k scroll  esc back  q quit